<h2>Version 1.2.0 on 2026-07-12</h2>

<h3>Two new themes</h3>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">doric-tiger</code> is a light theme, while <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">doric-lion</code> is dark. Both have
warm colours.</p>

<h3>Org agenda events are easier to spot</h3>

